# This file exists so Paths.qml can be a pragma Singleton. Once a directory has a
# qmldir, Qt stops auto-discovering sibling .qml files by filename — every component
# must be listed here or it fails with "X is not a type", which takes down the whole
# shell, not one widget. Add a line here whenever you add a component to this dir.
singleton Paths 1.0 Paths.qml
Bar 1.0 Bar.qml
Battery 1.0 Battery.qml
Brightness 1.0 Brightness.qml
ClipboardViewer 1.0 ClipboardViewer.qml
Clock 1.0 Clock.qml
IpcWatcher 1.0 IpcWatcher.qml
Launcher 1.0 Launcher.qml
NotificationCenter 1.0 NotificationCenter.qml
NotificationPopup 1.0 NotificationPopup.qml
RightSection 1.0 RightSection.qml
TrayIcon 1.0 TrayIcon.qml
Volume 1.0 Volume.qml
WindowTitle 1.0 WindowTitle.qml
WorkspaceButton 1.0 WorkspaceButton.qml
Workspaces 1.0 Workspaces.qml
